    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU; the controllers are usually reached through the AERCO BMS/ACS or an XPC gateway. Comm address 0 (input register 19) disables Modbus.",
    "Addresses are the manual's generic data addresses, from 0 (Modicon 30001/40001 + address).",
    "Temperatures are raw counts 0-1000 converted with the integer formulas of appendix A, table A-3; the scale and offset here give °F (the result is rounded in the controller). The same counts give °C with other factors (appendix A).",
    "32-bit counters are a low word followed by a high word (0-15).",
    "Registers for the BMS/BMS II and ACS controllers in the same manual are not in this map.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
